# 5F Project UI Conventions

Source of truth: `docs/UI-CONVENTIONS.md`. Follow these for every new screen and component.

## Dialog (modal centered)

Use `DIALOG_SIZE` from `lib/dialog-sizes.ts`:

| Purpose | Constant | Size |
|---------|----------|------|
| Confirm delete/cancel | `DIALOG_SIZE.CONFIRM` | max-w-sm |
| Simple picker | `DIALOG_SIZE.COMPACT` | max-w-md |
| Import/export/upload | `DIALOG_SIZE.LARGE` | max-w-2xl |
| Stats drill-down / data preview | `DIALOG_SIZE.XL` | max-w-4xl |
| Wide data preview | `DIALOG_SIZE.WIDE` | max-w-6xl |

Use `AppDialog` for new data preview modals; `ConfirmDialog` for destructive actions — do not roll custom confirm modals.
Use `StatsDrillDownDialog` for chart/table drill-down on stats tabs — do not `onTabChange('list')` on click.

## Drawer (slide from right)

From `lib/dialog-sizes.ts`:

| Purpose | Width | Notes |
|---------|-------|-------|
| Form & Detail (default) | 48rem | `DRAWER_WIDTH_FORM` / `DRAWER_WIDTH_DETAIL` |
| Stacked (opened from another drawer) | 44rem | `stackLevel >= 1`, `getDrawerWidthClass(1)` |
| Wide form with side panel | 82rem | `DRAWER_WIDTH_WIDE` |
| Nested detail compact | 36rem | `DRAWER_WIDTH_DETAIL_SMALL` |

- Use `GenericDrawer` with `stackLevel` prop (default 0)
- When opening detail from stats drill-down popup: `overlayTier="aboveDataDialog"` (z 190+)
- Z-index: `DRAWER_Z_BASE` / `DRAWER_Z_CONTENT_BASE`; data dialogs `Z_INDEX_DATA_DIALOG_CLASS`; app modals `Z_INDEX_APP_MODAL_CLASS`

## Sections (form & detail)

- Section titles **must** use primary color: `Section`, `FormSection`, or `DetailSection` with default `variant="primary"` → `text-primary`, `border-primary/20`
- Use `variant="muted"` only for truly secondary sections (rare)

## Submenu dashboard

- Group titles on module dashboards: `text-primary` via `ModuleDashboardLayout` (`groupTitle`)
- Placeholder submenus: `ComingSoonLayout` with `titlePrimary={true}`

## Form fields

- Required fields: `required={true}` on `Input` / `Textarea` (shows red asterisk)
- Validation still from Zod schema; `required` prop is display only
- Error text: `text-xs` under controls (built into ui components)

## Design tokens

**Border radius (do not mix arbitrarily):**
- `rounded-lg` — inputs, selects, textareas, buttons, chips
- `rounded-xl` — cards, panels, dropdown lists
- `rounded-2xl` — modal, drawer, dialog, MainCard

**Button heights:** `sm` = h-8, `default` = h-10 — match `Button` component sizes in toolbars and forms

## Toolbar & filters

- New toolbars: use `FilterChipMultiSelect` / `FilterChipSingleSelect` from `components/shared/`
- Do **not** build custom multi-select dropdowns
- Pass `filterGroups` to `GenericToolbar` for mobile (`MobileFilterSheet`)
- Counts: toolbar receives permission-filtered list; use `useFilterCounts` + `filterOptionsWithCount` (`hideZeroCount` default true)
- List action buttons (Add/Import/Export): use `ListToolbarIconButton` / `ListToolbarAddButton` from `components/shared/ListToolbarActions.tsx`; constants in `lib/toolbar-list-actions.ts`
- Reference: `CapPhatThuHoiToolbar`, `nhan-vien-toolbar`

## Stats tab — date range filter

- Default: `DEFAULT_STATS_DATE_PRESET_ID` (`all`) from `lib/stats-date-range.ts` — show all data, chip shows placeholder (not "this month")
- Use `DateRangePicker`; presets from `STANDARD_STATS_DATE_PRESET_IDS` + `custom` (includes **Năm trước**, rolling 7/30 days, 6 months)
- When `preset === 'all'`: omit `displayLabel`; skip as-at date filter in stats hooks
- Clear filters resets date to `all`; count active filters only when date preset is not `all`
- See `docs/UI-CONVENTIONS.md` § Tab Thống kê — filter thời gian

## Stats tab — data table

- Max **10 body rows** visible in viewport; scroll vertically beyond that (or when page size > 10)
- Constants: `lib/stats-table.ts` (`STATS_TABLE_MAX_BODY_ROWS`, `getStatsTableScrollMaxHeightCss()`)
- Multi-column stats tables: **`StatsDataGrid`** — listview styling, sticky header/first column, `TablePaginationFooter` (default page size 10)
- Simple 2-column tables: **`StatsTableCard`**
- Do not use full `GenericTable` for aggregate stats (no checkbox/actions column)
- Export reports use full dataset, not current page slice


## Detail drawer section order

- Order: **Summary card** → **DetailToolbar** → business **DetailSection** blocks → embedded child tables (if any) → **`DetailSystemSection` last**.
- System section: `tg_tao`, `tg_cap_nhat`; include `nguoi_tao` when the entity has it. Use `DetailSystemSection` from `@/components/views` — do not place child tables after system info.

## Detail sub-table (bảng con)

- Max **5 body rows** visible; scroll vertically beyond that
- Constants: `lib/detail-sub-table.ts` (`DETAIL_SUB_TABLE_MAX_BODY_ROWS`, `DETAIL_SUB_TABLE_SCROLL_MAX_HEIGHT`)
- Prefer `EmbeddedChildDataGrid` or `GenericSubTableSection` with default heights — do not grow unbounded in detail drawers

## Last-view flow (List ↔ Detail ↔ Form)

After cancel/save on Form, return to the screen that opened the form:

| Opened from | After close |
|-------------|-------------|
| List | Back to list (close detail) |
| Detail | Back to same detail (refresh record) |

- Type: `FormViewOrigin` in `lib/last-view-flow.ts`
- Factories: `handleEdit(item, 'list')` from table; `handleEdit(item, 'detail')` from detail drawer
- Custom hooks (`usePageHandlers`, `trackFormOrigin: true`) must follow the same rule

## View components

Import from `@/components/views` when building CRUD screens:

- List: `GenericTable`, `createFeatureModule`
- Detail: `DetailSection`, `DetailField`, `GenericDrawer`
- Form: `FormGrid`, `RhfDataField`, `FormStepper`
- Dashboard: `ModuleDashboardLayout`, `SubModuleCard`
- Feedback: Sonner toasts, `EmptyState`, `ConfirmDialog`

## Import dữ liệu

- Dùng `ImportDialog` + `lib/import/` (`runImportBatch`, `buildImportTemplate`, `buildErrorWorkbook`).
- Template: sheet `Du_lieu` + `Huong_dan` + lookup sheets cho FK/enum; module khai báo `importLookupSheets`.
- Kết quả: `ImportResult`; nút tải file lỗi khi có `failed`. Chi tiết: `docs/UI-CONVENTIONS.md` (Import dữ liệu).

## Export & documents

Project uses jsPDF, xlsx, print-service for ERP exports. For advanced Word/PDF/PPTX/XLSX generation, use skills in `.cursor/skills/` (docx, pdf, xlsx, pptx).

## Media upload (ảnh)

- Single image: **`SingleImageInput`** + `lib/media/` — xem `docs/UI-CONVENTIONS.md` § Tải ảnh / Media upload.
- Production: Cloudinary (`VITE_MEDIA_PROVIDER=cloudinary`); dev/mock: `local` base64.
- Logo công ty: `allowUrlInput`, folder `5f/company/logo`. Avatar: `shape="circle"`, folder `5f/employees/avatars`.

## Language

- UI copy: Vietnamese for end users
- Code, comments, commit messages: English or Vietnamese per existing file convention
